              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuthe sebebasongela futhi, babakhulula, bengafumani lutho lokuthi bangabajezisa kanjani ngenxa yabantu, ngokuba bonke babedumisa uNkulunkulu ngalokho okwenzekileyo.",
